<Docs title="Agent pool" description="Choose the order Shepherd uses to select an installed agent." toc={toc}>
  <h2 id="priority">Agent priority</h2>
  <p>Settings → Agent pool lists installed agents. Move them up or down to set their priority for new conversations.</p>
  <p>Shepherd selects the first available agent when you create a conversation. You can change the agent before sending the first prompt. If none is available, the draft stays editable and explains how to configure a harness.</p>
  <p>The order is stored as <code>agents.priority</code> in the <code>app</code> section of settings.json.</p>
</Docs>
